{
  "format_version": 1,
  "about": "Bandage by part (docs/gameplay/medical_actions_by_part_v1.md): a shin, sat on the ground (5 s, MedicalItem.BANDAGE_LEG_TICKS 100; MedicalItem sits the player down first and leaves them sat, sit/GroundSit). Keyed on the left leg, mirrored for the right. From the seat (body.sit) it leans well forward, the left knee comes up, its foot flat ahead, the right leg out to the side; three turns round the shin from 0.7 s, 1 s each, ankle to knee: the left hand takes the roll round the outside and under the shin, the right takes it there and brings it up the inside to the front while the left presses the front; the end laid on (3.7 s), torn off (3.9 s), patted twice, back to the seat from 4.4 s. The own first-person camera on the posed eye (first_person_eye). The roll (player_props/bandage) keyed every 0.05 s on a rounded path 1.4 px off the part; both arms solved by IK on it and baked into the clip as FK (hold_body). Written by tools/medical-actions-v1a/author_dress_v1.cjs.",
